      "summary": "As of 2026-10-28, the opened OCC program page and bank-application table, Federal Reserve 2026 and FDIC recent news listings, NYDFS entity directory and Greenlist, official Federal Register name searches and Mento disclosures did not identify KESm as having a public GENIUS permitted issuer approval, state qualification, official pending application or registered foreign exception. Searches included Mento Labs, Mento Protocol Foundation, AP Reserve Foundation and current or legacy token symbols. The Mento Federal Register search returned only unrelated historical notices; the two token and foundation alias searches returned zero results. The bank and state directories are not comprehensive GENIUS registers, the FDIC review is limited to its returned recent listing, and the legal issuer remains unresolved. This is a bounded dated public-evidence finding, not proof that no confidential or differently named filing exists.",
